WHAT THIS COVERS
----------------

1. The audio recordings in this repository and in its releases (the "Recordings").
2. The musical arrangements realised in those Recordings — the orchestration,
   part-writing, harmonisation and voicings (the "Arrangements").
3. The MIDI files in `midi/`, the text of this repository, and the layout of the
   player page.

The melody of "Greensleeves" is a traditional English tune in the public domain. No
copyright is claimed in that melody. Copyright is claimed in the Arrangements and the
Recordings — that is, in everything this project added to the tune.

